<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-PAST LIONS RECORD IN SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-PAST LIONS RECORD IN SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Past British Isles test</p>
<p>performances in South Africa (tabulate under: year, captain,</p>
<p>tests played, won, drawn, lost)</p>
<p> 1910   Dr T. Smyth	  3   1   0   2</p>
<p> 1924   Dr R. Cove-Smith   4   0   1   3</p>
<p> 1938   S.Walker	     3   1   0   2</p>
<p> 1955   R.H. Thompson	4   2   0   2</p>
<p> 1962   A.R. Smith	   4   0   1   3</p>
<p> 1968   T.J. Kiernan	 4   0   1   3</p>
<p> 1974   W.J. McBride	 4   3   1   0</p>
<p> 1980   W.B.Beaumont	 4   1   0   3</p>
<p>Total: Played 30, British Isles won 8, South Africa won 18, drawn 4. (NB. The 1910 tour is regarded as the first fully representative one in which the four home unions cooperated.)</p>
